        "name": "AnimScript",
        "source": "---===---===---===---===---===---===---===---===---===---===---===---===---===---===---===---===\r\n\r\ndone = true\r\n\r\nscript.Parent.Equipped:connect(function(m)\r\nc = script.Parent.Parent\r\nw = Instance.new(\"Weld\")\r\nw.Parent = script.Parent.Handle\r\nw.Part0 = w.Parent\r\nw.Part1 = script.Parent.Blade1\r\nw.C1 = CFrame.fromEulerAnglesXYZ(0,0,math.rad(90)) * CFrame.new(-0.26,-1.2,1.5)\r\nw = nil\r\n\r\nw = Instance.new(\"Weld\")\r\nw.Parent = script.Parent.Handle\r\nw.Part0 = w.Parent\r\nw.Part1 = script.Parent.Blade2\r\nw.C1 = CFrame.fromEulerAnglesXYZ(0,0,math.rad(-90)) * CFrame.new(0.26,-1.2,1.5)\r\nw = nil\r\nend)\r\n\r\nscript.Parent.Activated:connect(function()\r\nif not done then return end\r\ndone = false\r\na = c.Torso[\"Right Shoulder\"]\r\ni = 4.7\r\nrepeat \r\nwait(0.005)\r\na.C0 = CFrame.new(1,0.5,-i/20) * CFrame.fromEulerAnglesXYZ(0,-i,i/math.pi)\r\ni = i + 0.1\r\nuntil i >= 5.9\r\nrepeat \r\nwait(0.005)\r\na.C0 = CFrame.new(1,0.5,0) * CFrame.fromEulerAnglesXYZ(i - 20, -i, -i + 0.5)\r\ni = i - 0.1\r\nuntil i <= 4.5\r\nwait()\r\na.C0 = CFrame.new(1,0.5,0) * CFrame.fromEulerAnglesXYZ(0,-4.7,0)\r\ndone = true\r\nend)\r\n"
      }
